name: alt alignment;
%%
A<alt>this is the default alignment</alt>(fg) B<alt:l>this text is forced left</alt>(fg) C<alt:c>this text is forced center</alt>(fg) D<alt:r>this text is forced right</alt>(fg)
E(fg[alt:this is the default alignment]) F(fg[alt:this text is forced left;l]) G(fg[alt:this text is forced center;c]) H(fg[alt:this text is forced right;r]) (::)
